ware Update, nuove modifiche di design e un’evoluzione di Siri in “Siri AI”, con funzioni legate a Spotlight e Visual Intelligence.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16981,\"date\":\"2026-08-19T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-19T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"disponibili-ios-27-macos-golden-gate-beta-6-e-non-solo-ecco-tutte-le-novita\",\"title\":\"Disponibili iOS 27 e macOS Golden Gate beta 6 (e non solo): ecco tutte le novità\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia le beta 6 di iOS 27 e macOS Golden Gate, insieme alle versioni beta 6 di iPadOS 27, watchOS 27 e tvOS 27.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/ios-27-three-iphones-fi.jpg-768x384.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-27-three-iphones-fi.jpg\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16987,\"date\":\"2026-08-18T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-18T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-aggiunge-nuovi-wallpaper-macos-golden-gate-beta-6\",\"title\":\"Apple aggiunge nuovi wallpaper per macOS Golden Gate nella beta 6\",\"excerpt\":\"Nella sesta beta di macOS 27 arrivano due nuove opzioni di wallpaper a tema Golden Gate: Golden Gate Day e Golden Gate Evening, con animazioni all’accesso e modalità screen saver.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macos-golden-gate-day-wallpaper-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macos-golden-gate-day-wallpaper\",\"auth